# The SPA shell must never be cached at the edge. Cloudflare was serving a
# stale index.html against a newly deployed bundle whose predecessor had been
# purged, so the app fetched a missing script and mounted nothing — a blank
# page on the custom domain while the same build rendered fine on *.pages.dev.
#
# Everything under /_expo/static and /assets is content-hashed, so those are
# safe to cache forever.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/_expo/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
